[{"title":"柝声","author":"郑用锡","text":"折戟沉沙二百年，重闻严柝抱关前。\n白裘狗盗应难遁，绛帻鸡人不再眠。\n百堞孤城环守地，万家残月薄寒天。\n声声莫怨西风急，管钥微臣隐亦贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34646,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"机声","author":"郑用锡","text":"鲛室波寒不废机，何堪促织又声悲。\n倩桃悔抵青楼曲，苏蕙愁编锦字诗。\n十载故人从阁去，一灯慈母课儿时。\n报章拟向天河索，牛女当年事亦痴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34647,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"琴声","author":"郑用锡","text":"碧梧庭院七弦悲，埽地焚香待月迟。\n山水有缘应识我，斧柯莫假更何之？\n机心此后鸣蝉捕，绝调当年舞鹤知。\n霜籁一天花落去，可曾魂梦入牙期？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34648,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雁声","author":"郑用锡","text":"旧国啼霜浅渚边，入秋诗思冷于烟。\n江南客梦三千里，塞北音书十九年。\n露白不堪如此夜，月明无可奈何天。\n伤心寒到芦花水，莫叩潇湘渔父舷！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34649,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蛩声","author":"郑用锡","text":"亭院萧条秋草生，孤灯四壁夜三更。\n从军有女思何苦，卒岁无衣懒亦惊。\n高枕最难将梦续，空阶况是欲天明。\n半间堂圮昏钟动，落叶江山漫战争。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34650,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸡声","author":"郑用锡","text":"振衣猛省恶声来，起舞刘琨匣剑开。\n断尾却怜身自弃，雄冠犹冀世多才。\n危关无路何人唱，茅店残更有月催。\n寄语司晨休错过，汝南埘桀长蒿莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34651,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蝉声","author":"郑用锡","text":"独听宫槐寒雨晴，荒凉不似去年声。\n此心高尚原难饱，无口何缘解喜鸣。\n莫作化身中夜泣，争禁久客万愁生。\n劲风危露休呜咽，我亦头衔一例清。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34652,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其一 小楼听雨","author":"郑用锡","text":"南楼凭几坐，过雨又潇潇。\n有味青灯夜，为予破寂寥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34653,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其二 晓亭春望","author":"郑用锡","text":"閒立此孤亭，春光到眼青。\n东南山最好，金碧列围屏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34654,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其三 莲池泛舟","author":"郑用锡","text":"鼓楫正中流，莲塘泛小舟。\n连城桥下过，四面芰荷浮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34655,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其四 石桥垂钓","author":"郑用锡","text":"且理钓鱼丝，石桥独坐时。\n一竿遗世虑，最爱夕阳迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34656,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其五 小山丛竹","author":"郑用锡","text":"有山兼有竹，宜夏亦宜秋。\n绝似筼筜谷，新封千户侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34657,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其六 深院读书","author":"郑用锡","text":"逍遥深院里，一片读书声。\n金石开环堵，应推福地名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34658,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其七 曲槛看花","author":"郑用锡","text":"新筑辟蒿莱，名花倚槛栽。\n迎年长有菊，羯鼓不须催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34659,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"新拟北郭园八景 其八 陌田观稼","author":"郑用锡","text":"好雨平畴足，门前似罫棋。\n绘来台笠好，一一聚东菑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34660,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"目力","author":"郑用锡","text":"目力无多不似前，看花如雾更茫然。\n笑他秋水双瞳剪，我已劳劳七十年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34661,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叹老","author":"郑用锡","text":"裘马五陵同学辈，云龙下上日相亲。\n那知到老交游尽，落落孤踪剩此身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34662,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盂兰会三首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"中元肆赦事荒唐，点鬼如何岁岁忙。\n变幻岂真有地狱，人心险恶即桁杨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34663,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盂兰会三首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"燄口家家说账孤，盘堆珍果酒盈壶。\n若敖有鬼如真馁，博得酆都一饭无？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34664,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"盂兰会三首 其三","author":"郑用锡","text":"姓氏编排各一行，先期觉路列灯光。\n喧天箫鼓鱼龙舞，举国今宵尽若狂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34665,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虚名","author":"郑用锡","text":"一生尽博此虚名，经济文章两不成。\n天亦曲全宽赋予，免教泯没度升平。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34666,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"童子普","author":"郑用锡","text":"寸魂尺魄竟丛丛，普施彭殇一例同。\n知否草元亭下路，童乌今日哭秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34667,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中元观城隍神账孤二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"神辇扶来卤簿哗，满街首火迓爷爷。\n不知男女缘何事，为解凶灾共荷枷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34668,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"中元观城隍神账孤二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"恤祭阴孤饭满筐，抛遗尘土杂馀粮。\n可怜南邑珠同贵，莫贷监河半粒偿！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34669,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"安晚","author":"郑用锡","text":"最爱安閒乐晚年，人生何事被尘牵！\n我今亦自称安晚，要与吾家作比肩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34670,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十年","author":"郑用锡","text":"十年难学到诗翁，少不如人老岂工！\n只为村居无一事，聊将晚景付吟筒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34671,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"梁儿添孙喜赋","author":"郑用锡","text":"七十筵开北海樽，才经两月又生孙。\n老夫正喜含饴弄，他日能兴通德门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34672,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏作","author":"郑用锡","text":"转眼光阴境易迁，敢云心绪似当年。\n而今已作泥沾絮，不学神仙只学禅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34673,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舂槟榔","author":"郑用锡","text":"生长蛮烟瘴雨乡，非关消食馈槟榔。\n可怜衰齿全无用，薄味仍须借汝尝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34674,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月菊花 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"历尽风霜年复年，天留晚节斗繁妍。\n春花不比秋花瘦，此是延龄第一仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34675,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"三月菊花 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"处士家非富贵家，偏教冷艳作春华。\n莫嫌老圃无颜色，又向东君殿百花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34676,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"小孙放风筝，志勖","author":"郑用锡","text":"昂藏意气入云烟，喜放风筝到九天。\n要识扶摇能直上，全凭一线手中牵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34677,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"借菊","author":"郑用锡","text":"三径新开欲仿陶，愧无素艳负清高。\n借人颜色秋花好，伴我来题九日糕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34678,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凌虚台","author":"郑用锡","text":"亭亭花木恰相宜，添筑高楼景更奇。\n赢得亲朋相过访，敢誇好客郑当时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34679,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和迂谷题赠北郭园原韵三首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"斋居环堵半依城，到老全无一事成。\n差喜青灯仍有味，时听儿辈读书声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34680,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和迂谷题赠北郭园原韵三首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"一局残棋袖手观，园林拓地水云宽。\n人间熟梦知多少，敢托高名不爱官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34681,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和迂谷题赠北郭园原韵三首 其三","author":"郑用锡","text":"閒来又自种花忙，为借春阴奏绿章。\n他日亲朋重访处，好教认作郑公乡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34682,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感作","author":"郑用锡","text":"劳劳相送碧油幢，遗爱重寻系马桩。\n一笑衣冠同傀儡，上场又说换新腔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34683,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"兴到时将墨细磨，长笺一幅自吟哦。\n此中别有长生术，自古神仙脉望多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34684,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"杂咏二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"世事如今果大难，人情反覆似波澜。\n只须静守江头看，不上滩来便下滩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34685,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孔雀生卵不自伏，以雌鸡代之 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"螟蛉果裸负来奇，松柏曾相附兔丝。\n谁料朱公同饮啄，家禽从此是同支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34686,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"孔雀生卵不自伏，以雌鸡代之 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"世俗多忘位置卑，攀鸾附凤漫相欺。\n却怜五色圆文辈，转与微禽共?埘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34687,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"斋柳为飓风所催，以绳系之","author":"郑用锡","text":"生来弱质易飘零，谁向风前独乞灵。\n我欲长绳垂地绾，莫教人误护花铃！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34688,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即事感怀","author":"郑用锡","text":"身世由来似转篷，拍浮一笑总成空。\n何如早返中流楫，几个归帆遇顺风？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34689,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"郑用锡","text":"迟迟钟鼓数残更，一枕黄梁梦不成。\n犹记早朝趋侍日，花阴曙色听宫莺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34690,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"独坐无聊，为景孙评文","author":"郑用锡","text":"故交零落已无多，风雨漫天自啸歌。\n幸有小同亲侍立，一庭书带影婆娑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34691,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老来娇 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"千红万紫斗繁华，独立西风对暮霞。\n羡汝经霜颜色好，一枝一叶胜如花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34692,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老来娇 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"何须顾盼属东君，叶叶流丹映夕曛。\n偏向空山饶晚节，秋娘未许妒同群。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34693,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冬至前二日大雨","author":"郑用锡","text":"南檐曝背一冬晴，忽听芭蕉叶有声。\n记否雪花如掌大，围炉旧梦在春明。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34694,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"伤心死别廿年期，往事依依泪暗垂。\n回忆深闺初待字，当时辛苦觅门楣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34695,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"二八于归正及笄，钗荆裙布作山妻。\n记曾花下相携日，我亦淳于竟赘齐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34696,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其三","author":"郑用锡","text":"竟谢繁华井臼操，多君晨夕独勤劳。\n草庐次第春风到，看取门前驷马高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34697,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其四","author":"郑用锡","text":"添香夜夜理残篇，但祝儿夫早著鞭。\n人愿天从同一笑，黉宫长忆听钟年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34698,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其五","author":"郑用锡","text":"食性能谙赖有君，南陔馐膳相夫勤。\n秋风一棹三山梦，戒旦鸡声尚汝闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34699,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其六","author":"郑用锡","text":"秋闱三度两春明，计日看登万里程。\n差喜泥金相慰藉，看侬甲乙榜题名。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34700,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其七","author":"郑用锡","text":"兰台走马正应官，惆怅临歧泪暗弹。\n祗为瘦躯愁汝病，别时容易见时难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34701,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其八","author":"郑用锡","text":"频年药石觅参苓，瘦骨谁怜镜里形。\n却幸归田汝无恙，眼看儿子擢明经。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34702,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其九","author":"郑用锡","text":"一索充闾喜气盈，笄珈三度拜恩荣。\n如何西笑拈花去，未听儿曹奏鹿鸣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34703,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"补悼亡作十首 其十","author":"郑用锡","text":"刹那五十一年身，营奠营斋更怆神。\n此去应无泉壤憾，鸾章新拜太夫人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34704,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叹老二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"百岁光阴一笑堪，我今得七尚馀三。\n自惭于世都无补，生死书丛作蠹蟫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34705,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叹老二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"系腰观井说彭篯，泥絮风情入定年。\n不管雨云纷变态，得邀无事便神仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34706,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感悟","author":"郑用锡","text":"富贵功名岂夙因，半由天定半由人。\n而今回忆当年事，始觉先机验若神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34707,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自解","author":"郑用锡","text":"功名何必较赢输，一枕黄梁有若无。\n领取老庄齐物论，此中劳逸总悬殊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34708,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"春晴望雨","author":"郑用锡","text":"清明时节未纷纷，天半谁为出岫云？\n但卜天心来日雨，家家豚酒赛榆枌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34709,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"灯下口占","author":"郑用锡","text":"荏苒光阴只自怜，一灯兀坐爱逃禅。\n老夫不解烧丹术，赢得清閒便是仙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34710,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自叹","author":"郑用锡","text":"晨星朋辈鬓皤皤，回首前尘一剃那。\n试看儿童都长大，始知人世阅来多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34711,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题曼倩偷桃图二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"托根仙界实离离，王母堂前结子时。\n漫道仙家能辟谷，如何臣朔尚称饥？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34712,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题曼倩偷桃图二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"岁星等是地行仙，偷得蟠桃阆苑前。\n三度去来真一瞥，人间已是九千年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34713,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"戏赠鹤珊","author":"郑用锡","text":"托迹潜园宇宙宽，故乡岁月乐盘桓。\n使君疑是陶宏景，既爱山林更爱官。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34714,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴宫教战二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"无端盘马学弯弓，满地燕支一笑空。\n回忆兵符金帐窃，魏妃还是女英雄。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34715,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"吴宫教战二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"阵云惨淡暗吴宫，狼籍桃花血溅红。\n千古马嵬同一辙，美人无计奈英雄！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34716,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高渐离筑","author":"郑用锡","text":"十载潜身托宋佣，解装未出发先冲。\n如何又误咸阳击，暴魄空教褫祖龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34717,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"游子吟","author":"郑用锡","text":"落拓江湖壮志违，扁舟何日挂帆归？\n伤心累却深闺妇，无岁秋风不寄衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34718,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"班妃团扇","author":"郑用锡","text":"炎京阅尽扇中身，长信宫寒月似银。\n料得秋风肠断日，相怜惟有竹夫人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34719,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忍冻敲诗二首 其一","author":"郑用锡","text":"蛮烟瘴雨暗江滨，瘦尽梅花悟昔因。\n到底不知风雪苦，策驴犹自觅前身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34720,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忍冻敲诗二首 其二","author":"郑用锡","text":"砚冰料峭笔呵频，耸立吟肩雪一身。\n怕冷诗僮私自语，可怜辛苦作词人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34721,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"避债台","author":"郑用锡","text":"纷纷叩阙索逋人，高筑危台不讳贫。\n堪笑一朝天子贵，头衔至竟亚钱神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34722,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"饯春","author":"郑用锡","text":"离筵狼籍落花辰，燕子莺哥孰主宾？\n寄语东君须痛饮，十千婪尾莫辞贫！","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":34723,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]